#. Content of the 'Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Property Setter'
#: frappe/custom/doctype/property_setter/property_setter.json
msgid "&lt;div class=\"alert\"&gt;Please don't update it as it can mess up your form. Use the Customize Form View and Custom Fields to set properties!&lt;/div&gt;"
msgstr "&lt;div class=\"alert\"&gt;Mohon jangan perbarui ini karena dapat merusak formulir Anda. Gunakan Tampilan Kustomisasi Formulir dan Bidang Kustom untuk mengatur properti!&lt;/div&gt;"

#. Content of the 'Help HTML' (HTML) field in DocType 'Document Naming
#. Settings'
#: frappe/core/doctype/document_naming_settings/document_naming_settings.json
msgid ""
"&lt;div class=\"well\"&gt;\n"
"    Edit list of Series in the box. Rules:\n"
"    &lt;ul&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;Each Series Prefix on a new line.&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;Allowed special characters are \"/\" and \"-\"&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;\n"
"            Optionally, set the number of digits in the series using dot (.)\n"
"            followed by hashes (#). For example, \".####\" means that the series\n"
"            will have four digits. Default is five digits.\n"
"        &lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;\n"
"            You can also use variables in the series name by putting them\n"
"            between (.) dots\n"
"            &lt;br&gt;\n"
"            Supported Variables:\n"
"            &lt;ul&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.YYYY.&lt;/code&gt; - Year in 4 digits&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.YY.&lt;/code&gt; - Year in 2 digits&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.MM.&lt;/code&gt; - Month&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.DD.&lt;/code&gt; - Day of month&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.WW.&lt;/code&gt; - Week of the year&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;\n"
"                    &lt;code&gt;.{fieldname}.&lt;/code&gt; - fieldname on the document e.g.\n"
"                    &lt;code&gt;branch&lt;/code&gt;\n"
"                &lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.FY.&lt;/code&gt; - Fiscal Year (requires ERPNext to be installed)&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.ABBR.&lt;/code&gt; - Company Abbreviation (requires ERPNext to be installed)&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"            &lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"        &lt;/li&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"    Examples:\n"
"    &lt;ul&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INV-&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INV-10-&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INVK-&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;br&gt;\n"

msgstr ""
"&lt;div class=\"well\"&gt;\n"
"    Edit daftar Seri di kotak. Aturan:\n"
"    &lt;ul&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;Setiap Awalan Seri pada baris baru.&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;Karakter khusus yang diizinkan adalah \"/\" dan \"-\"&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;\n"
"            Secara opsional, atur jumlah digit dalam seri menggunakan titik (.)\n"
"            diikuti oleh tanda pagar (#). Contoh, \".####\" berarti seri\n"
"            akan memiliki empat digit. Standarnya adalah lima digit.\n"
"        &lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;\n"
"            Anda juga dapat menggunakan variabel dalam nama seri dengan menempatkannya\n"
"            di antara titik (.)\n"
"            &lt;br&gt;\n"
"            Variabel yang Didukung:\n"
"            &lt;ul&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.YYYY.&lt;/code&gt; - Tahun dalam 4 digit&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.YY.&lt;/code&gt; - Tahun dalam 2 digit&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.MM.&lt;/code&gt; - Bulan&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.DD.&lt;/code&gt; - Hari dalam bulan&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.WW.&lt;/code&gt; - Minggu dalam tahun&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;\n"
"                    &lt;code&gt;.{fieldname}.&lt;/code&gt; - nama bidang pada dokumen, contoh:\n"
"                    &lt;code&gt;branch&lt;/code&gt;\n"
"                &lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.FY.&lt;/code&gt; - Tahun Fiskal (membutuhkan ERPNext terinstal)&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"                &lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.ABBR.&lt;/code&gt; - Singkatan Perusahaan (membutuhkan ERPNext terinstal)&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"            &lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"        &lt;/li&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"    Contoh:\n"
"    &lt;ul&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INV-&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INV-10-&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INVK-&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"        &lt;li&gt;INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####&lt;/li&gt;\n"
"    &lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;br&gt;\n"

#. Content of the 'Example' (HTML) field in DocType 'Workflow Transition'
#: frappe/workflow/doctype/workflow_transition/workflow_transition.json
msgid ""
"<pre><code>doc.grand_total &gt; 0</code></pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Conditions should be written in simple Python. Please use properties available in the form only.</p>\n"
"<p>Allowed functions:\n"
"</p><ul>\n"
"<li>frappe.db.get_value</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.db.get_list</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.session</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.now_datetime</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.get_datetime</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.add_to_date</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.now</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>Example: </p><pre><code>doc.creation &gt; frappe.utils.add_to_date(frappe.utils.now_datetime(), days=-5, as_string=True, as_datetime=True) </code></pre><p></p>"
msgstr ""
"<pre><code>doc.grand_total &gt; 0</code></pre>\n"
"<p>Kondisi harus ditulis dalam Python sederhana. Harap gunakan properti yang hanya tersedia di formulir.</p>\n"
"<p>Fungsi yang diizinkan:\n"
"</p><ul>\n"
"<li>frappe.db.get_value</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.db.get_list</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.session</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.now_datetime</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.get_datetime</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.add_to_date</li>\n"
"<li>frappe.utils.now</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>Contoh: </p><pre><code>doc.creation &gt; frappe.utils.add_to_date(frappe.utils.now_datetime(), days=-5, as_string=True, as_datetime=True) </code></pre><p></p>"

